title Cassette Bluetooth (T4, synthetic names): the headset is connecting: "Connecting the headset..." in the notice place (the strip, or the counter row) while the meter stays dark; a tap on the narrow screens hides it
sizes 320x480 480x320 480x800 640x480 800x480 480x480 720x720
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO idle
env CASSETTE_DEMO_BT connecting
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 500
expect text "Connecting the headset..."
shot rec-connecting
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
@320x480 tap "Connecting the headset..."
@320x480 wait 300
@320x480 expect notext "Connecting the headset..."
@320x480 say a tap hid the standing notice
@320x480 expect text "SOFT"
expect noquit
